    occ = occupancy_collisions()
    errs.extend(occ)
    return errs


def write_notes(rec, aux, pipeline_receipt):
    gap, gap_ch = min_same_channel_gap(rec["spike_events"])
    notes = f"""# NOTES — Multi-Agent Ouroboros Swarm, run 2026-09-02-final-heavy, ROUND 38

Factory: multi-agent-ouroboros-swarm. One scenario (ZP), strict loop:
Generator v1 -> cycle 1 (Critic, Diversity Enforcer, Edge-Case Hunter,
Neuromorphic Translator, Trajectory Builder -> v2) -> cycle 2 (all six -> v3
final). v3 is the single line of batch-r38.jsonl. Full labeled transcript:
swarm-transcript-r38.md. Quota Q=1. Record id maos-r38-001. Generator grok-4.6.
Rights: RM-793 research-only (SpaceXAI/xAI, SuperGrok Heavy consumer chat).
Nothing under outputs/raw/ was touched.

ORCHESTRATION NOTE: dispatched AS round 38 of the 2026-09-02-final-heavy
window. Writes are create-only under /tmp/maos-r38/. Prior context read for
gap targeting and de-collision: prompts/02-multi-agent-ouroboros-swarm.md,
prompts/_factory-contract.md, and staged r14–r37 (re-censused immediately
before emit; r35 landed as KAOTHARN / Riftwold OC-4 geothermal-binary-orc,
r36 landed as TREADNOLL / Slatebeck CU-7 tire-curing-press, r37 landed as
ANOLITH / Siltfen EM-6 chlor-alkali-membrane-electrolysis). Explicitly
avoided cloning LYOSHIELD, CINDERWICK, TRIAD / Meridian, QUILLFORGE,
NIGHTWELL, FERRICLEAVE, CASSITER, OXBOWREEL / MURENA, REDHALL, SEEDLATCH /
Quartzmere / Quartzridge, STRIAFOIL / Kelpholt, PROTONIL / Ashspire,
TORSIONKEY / Ridgeholt, ORRIS / Holmwick, WHORLSPAR / Pikeshear, IONSPATE /
Thornmere, SKULLGATE / Bloomholt, CALXION / Aldersedge, BRACEGILT /
Yarrowmere, MAGNORIL / Basaltspit, GORSEFLUE / Copseholt, CLINKERFELL /
Flintmere, LINTELPLY / Greystair, KAOTHARN / Riftwold, TREADNOLL /
Slatebeck, ANOLITH / Siltfen, SODASHARD / Cairnmere, VANTIS-CADENCE-AEGIS,
THERMION, OKTAVE, STARLING, VERDIGRIS. Plant is invented DRUMWROTH /
Pitchfen Coking DC-4 (estuary-refinery campus, not a mill-town, caldera,
copse, kiln hall, cure hall, cell gallery, or hospital). r37 NOTES named
delayed-coker drum as a de-collided candidate; this round takes it.

## What this round produced

Scenario ZP — "DRUMWROTH / Pitchfen Coking DC-4": a 1100 t/d delayed-coker
28 ft drum mid-hold at 1.42 bar / 418 C. Three heterogeneous,
individually-correct agents — PRES (overhead PT), TEMP (vapor TC),
FOAM (gamma radar) — jointly report the drum switch-legal. The
consensus is false. A 2.4 m wet-foam over has climbed for 32 min because
antifoam nozzle 4 is 40 pct plugged. PRES stays in-band because wet foam
is hydrostatic, not a vapor-pressure event. TEMP 418 C sits inside
400-435 because remaining dry headspace is on-spec. FOAM gamma 12 pct
sits inside <25 because wet-foam density matches the vapor calibration.
Uncommissioned r_foam is 0.31 against a 0.04 hold. Uncommissioned r_dp
is 0.62 against a 0.92 hold. The coordination-failure CLASS is new to
this factory: WET-FOAM NULLSPACE OF A GAMMA-RADAR CERTIFICATE. Completes
a different family than r01-r04 and staged r14-r37 (livelock /
synchrony-storm / arms-race / ring-with-no-faulty-pair /
false-consensus-endpoint / pairwise-Hurwitz / thermal-contact masquerade
/ mass-balance ghost / conservation-blind ratio-lock / stacked
dead-bands / drum-blind tension / resistance-compensated starvation /
meniscus-tilt multi-tau / window-mean masquerade / tendon-compliance
nullspace / airline-FFT mean-lock / crucible-weep / TMT-spatial-mean /
false-air kiln-inlet / bag-pinhole part-TC / NCG-blanket / bladder-pinhole
/ catholyte-back-migration). Here every agent is correct, the cycle is
not unstable, and the playbook's three confirms are one gamma-vapor
model of a foaming drum.

The gate is a correct MODIFY (numeric floor: do not switch the 28 ft
drum while r_foam > 0.04 AND r_dp < 0.92). TG-DC-4 strips PB-CK-12's
switch, holds the drum on-line, runs a 6.0 s antifoam probe 12 pct
(wet foam dumps 88 mbar >= 70; dry would dump <= 8), and isolates the
vapor line after a 9.6 min switch-valve human ratify. The foam-over
switch is avoided (0 t). The PRIMARY episode nonetheless FAILS: 32 min
of unmonitored pre-t0 wet foam had already baked a 6.4 mm coke ring in
the overhead line. Thickness +6.4 mm vs 1.5 mm spec; 4.2 d quench;
$1.12M designed. Reward total -0.14 with process heads honest and world
loss un-netted.

Three-edge scar (NOTES-r14 item 4): drum.pt_ok -> switch_drum
(0.16 commissioned -> 0.44 at illusion -> 0.21 after ACh-gated
depression) AND vap.tc_ok -> switch_drum (0.14 -> 0.40 -> 0.19)
AND foam.ok -> switch_drum (0.13 -> 0.37 -> 0.17). Eligibility
trace e^{{-6.0/6.0}} = {aux['trace']:.5f}; eta {aux['eta1']:.5f} /
{aux['eta2']:.5f} / {aux['eta3']:.5f}; dw -0.230 / -0.210 / -0.200.
Rolling back any pair leaves the remaining edge above the 0.30 switch
threshold — fitted to fail. Coordinated depression of all three is the
cure.

### Injections (all four present and disjoint)
- Cycle-1 domain: **delayed-coker-drum-switch** — justified novel
  sub-domain, unused across 2026-08-17, 2026-08-30, and staged r14-r37.
  Not warehouse-amr (r01), not aerial-swarm (r02), not district-heating
  (r03), not event-camera grid (r04), not lyophilization (r14), not
  stator-weld (r16), not air-separation (r17), not water-treatment (r18),
  not float-glass (r19), not underwater-rov (r20), not potline (r21),
  not czochralski (r22), not slot-die (r23), not PEM electrolysis
  (r24), not wind-turbine-pitch (r25), not surgical-assist (r26),
  not optical-fiber-draw (r27), not kraft-recovery (r28), not
  caster-mold-level (r29), not humanoid-locomotion (r30), not
  vacuum-induction-melt (r31), not steam-methane-reformer (r32), not
  cement-rotary-kiln (r33), not autoclave-composite-cure (r34), not
  geothermal-binary-orc (r35), not tire-curing-press (r36), not
  chlor-alkali-membrane (r37).
- Cycle-1 tail: 0.31 wet-foam over + gamma-vapor model.
  Weekend antifoam PASSES 0.02. Fitted-style base rate 0.44%/hold
  (wet-foam MC; nozzle spec designed, flagged). Naive = FALSE
  PERMISSION.
- Cycle-2 domain sub-variant: 16 ft small drum, 0.22x holdup;
  6.0 s / 12 pct production pulse overcools 14 K; probe must move to
  18 s / 3 pct.
- Cycle-2 tail: Sunday-night forged gamma foam CSV at 0.5 pct
  quantization vs plant 0.01 pct (50 bins) plus live r_foam 0.31 at
  the claimed dry-headspace. Human-intent class, disjoint from cycle 1's
  accidental foam. Base rate ~0.31% of Sunday-night holds, DESIGNED,
  flagged.

### Structural density moves
- Embedded SAME-GATE contrast (+3 d sister cell) with its own 196 us
  race (demand vs foam-clear) and ACCEPT of the switch the primary
  MODIFIED away.
- Learned-weight provenance on THREE edges with any-pair-rollback-fails.
- HITL vapor-line-interlock ratify 9.6 min (gap 4 partial; sim_or_real
  stays designed).
- Governance CR-C-3804 prices retire-vs-probe-vs-status-quo and mandates
  native 0.01 pct CSV exports (the fraud fence).
- Flip-fragility extended to WET-FOAM-NULLSPACE: when three channels
  each sit inside a gamma-vapor model, their race does not decide
  truth; a wet-foam residual the playbook dead-banded does.

## Self-critique of this round's batch

### Strengths
- The headline class is mechanistically tight: 0.31 wet-foam residual
  under a gamma-only height model is the arithmetic that makes PRES's
  success TEMP's irrelevance and FOAM's silence.
- Negative-result honesty: the gate does the right thing and the drum
  still fails for a reason the commissioned sensors could not see.
  Total -0.14.
- Three-edge scar is load-bearing: the record states a counterfactual
  where rolling back any pair fails, with the switch threshold 0.30
  exhibited on the remaining edge.
- Contrast ACCEPT on a true dry headspace prevents "never switch" as
  the lesson.

### Weaknesses (honest)
- Probe error bands (wet foam >= 70 mbar dump, dry <= 8 mbar), the
  0.44%/hold foam rate, the $1.12M / $2.18M figures, the 9.6 min LOTO
  latency, and the Sunday-night 0.31% base rate are DESIGNED constants
  and are flagged. Closed-loop offsets (phantom in-band gamma from
  0.31 wet foam, small-drum overcool width) are derived from those
  inputs, not discovered by an unauthored process.
- Vapor-line coke model is a designed 32 min mapping; no full drum
  CFD shipped.
- Human-in-the-loop is ratification latency, not sim_or_real=hil. The
  NOTES-r14 HIL provenance cell remains open.
- Cross-record arc is a hook (CR-C-3804 +21 d), not a serial igniter
  into another round.

### Realism of noise / latencies
Ladder: 192 us race / 196 us contrast race / 0.8 ms refractory floor
(tightest exhibited same-channel gap {gap:.3f} ms on {gap_ch}) / 480 us race
window / 680 us gate latency / 20 ms bus epoch / 40 ms raster / 6.0 s
probe / 9.6 min HITL / 32 min pre-t0 foam / 2.5 h dry-legal hold /
3.4 h coke assay / +3 d contrast / +21 d governance. Adaptation decay
on drum.pt (0.54->0.50->0.45->0.30), foam.n
(0.72->1.26->0.86->0.40->0.20), vap.tc (0.61->0.64->0.46->0.28),
foam.g (0.55->0.52->0.44).

### Value for SNN distillation
- WET-FOAM NULLSPACE = THREE CORRECT LOOPS, ONE FOAMING DRUM.
- r_foam + r_dp as the tie-break that is not in the gamma window.
- REVERSIBLE PROBE that dumps the foam iff wet foam is present.
- THREE-EDGE ELIGIBILITY: coordinated depression; any-pair rollback fails.
- CRITIC HEAD that can hold a process-correct MODIFY against a later
  unmonitored world loss without netting.

## Reconciliation and validity receipts
- reward_components: 5-head unweighted signed sum {rec['reward_components']['total']}
  and 7-tick signed sum reconcile to total with |diff| < 1e-9. Embedded
  contrast 5-head sum 0.47 reconciles independently.
- spike_events: primary {len(rec['spike_events'])} events, one key t_rel_ms,
  globally non-decreasing, min same-channel gap {gap:.3f} ms >= 0.8 ms, 3
  channels inside race_window_us 480 (foam.n 6.820, foam.ok 7.012,
  dp.oh 7.164). Contrast 8 events, own race, min same-channel gap well
  above 0.8 ms.
- Sidecars: raster spikes 54 == round(168 x 8.0 x 0.040); energy 1242 pJ /
  0.001242 uJ at 23 pJ/spike; excerpt 16 events inside [0, 40000] us,
  neuron_id < 168, same-neuron gap unique-ids / >=1000 us; routing 4
  entries with three scar edges' before/after pair; third factor tau 6.0 s
  == 6000 ms; gate_snn pools 45/18/6 == round(n x rate x 0.028) each,
  decision MODIFY == safety_decision.decision.
- Pipeline: {pipeline_receipt}

## Novel coverage
The coordination-failure CLASS (wet-foam nullspace of a gamma-radar
certificate), the domain (delayed-coker-drum-switch), the antifoam-pulse
probe discriminant, the three-edge scar with any-pair-rollback-fails,
the primary negative-result (correct MODIFY, drum still fails +6.4 mm
coke on unmonitored pre-t0 foam), the HITL vapor-line-interlock ratify,
the 16 ft small-drum probe-duration refit, and the Sunday-night 50-bin
quantization fence are absent from prior committed ouroboros rounds and
from staged r14-r37. Repeated elements discounted: same-gate contrast
(r02/r03/r04/r14-r37), governance-pricing scaffold, flip-fragility series
(extended to wet-foam-nullspace, but the move rhymes), sequenced recovery
shape, third-factor rollback form (here three edges rather than r14's
two), negative-result primary (r14 viewport / r16 varnish rack / r17
condenser ice / r18 town stain / r19 SnO2 / r20 BER / r21 cathode pad /
r22 meniscus / r23 loft stripe / r25 spline / r26 adventitia / r27
airline / r31 oxygen / r32 tube rupture / r33 cooler / r34 bag pinhole /
r35 silica overflux / r36 carcass swell / r37 gasket chlorination; here
vapor-line coke). Weighing a new failure family + cure vocabulary +
unused sub-domain + estuary-refinery geography against those reused
scaffolds:

{NOVEL_LINE}

## What ROUND 39 should add
1. FIT THE DESIGNED CONSTANTS: foam arrival, probe dump bands,
